[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0004","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-32781","title":"Apollo Portal 配置中心未授权访问漏洞","description":"Apollo 配置中心 Portal 在 2.5.0 版本之前存在未授权访问漏洞。当目标环境启用了 configView.memberOnly.envs 配置时，低权限认证用户可直接向 /envs/{env}/releases/{releaseId} 接口发送请求，通过构造有效的 release ID 绕过权限校验，获取其未被授权的应用或命名空间的配置发布数据。该接口未调用 UserPermissionValidator.shouldHideConfigToCurrentUser 进行权限检查，导致敏感配置信息泄露。攻击者需拥有 Portal 的低权限账号并知晓目标 release ID，攻击门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-32781","GHSA-jxpj-9j24-w337"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Apollo Portal 至 2.5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复未授权访问问题。修复提交为 apolloconfig/apollo@362735d，对应 PR #5378。如无法立即升级，可启用 configView.memberOnly.envs 配置并严格限制环境访问权限，同时在网关或反向代理层对 GET /envs/{env}/releases/{releaseId} 接口添加额外的身份校验中间件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/apolloconfig/apollo/security/advisories/GHSA-jxpj-9j24-w337","https://github.com/apolloconfig/apollo/pull/5378","https://github.com/apolloconfig/apollo/commit/362735ded4f13b62f6ab9df135d7096066e8e291","https://github.com/apolloconfig/apollo/releases/tag/v2.5.0"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0001","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-45422","title":"Proximus b-box 路由器 UPnP 访问控制不当漏洞","description":"Proximus b-box 路由器 UPnP 功能存在访问控制不当漏洞（CWE-284）。已获得路由器管理权限的攻击者可利用该缺陷绕过正常的访问限制机制，未经授权直接修改端口转发规则，导致内部网络服务被意外暴露至公网，增加被远程攻击的风险。该漏洞影响 Proximus b-box v8c.725A 版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。建议用户及时关注厂商固件更新以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-45422"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-09T21:16:54Z","updated":"2026-07-10T18:53:55Z","remediation":"建议立即登录 Proximus b-box 路由器管理后台（通常为 192.168.1.1），在「维护」或「系统」页面检查固件更新，将固件升级至 v8c.725A 及以后修复版本。如厂商尚未发布补丁，可在「高级设置」中关闭 UPnP 服务（取消勾选「启用 UPnP」），并限制管理界面仅允许内网 IP 地址访问，以防止攻击者从外部网络利用该漏洞修改端口转发规则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://b-box.com","http://proximus.com","https://github.com/Cedrico03/CVE-2025-45422---Bbox","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln-metrics/cvss/v3-calculator?vector=AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H/E:H/RL:U/RC:C/CR:H/IR:H/AR:H/MAV:N/MAC:L/MPR:N/MUI:N/MS:C/MC:H/MI:H/MA:H&version=3.1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0001.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0002","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-58151","title":"Xapi varstored 条件竞争漏洞","description":"varstored 是 Xapi 工具栈中处理虚拟机 UEFI 变量的核心组件，其与虚拟机内部的 OVMF 通过共享缓冲区进行通信。由于缺少足够的编译器内存屏障，共享缓冲区中的数据存在 TOCTOU（时间检查与使用时间）竞态条件漏洞，攻击者可通过提前修改共享缓冲区内容来操控跳转表中的索引，可能导致任意代码执行或信息泄露。该漏洞影响使用 Xapi 工具栈的虚拟化平台，CVSS 评分 9.4，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-58151"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-09T16:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-09T17:16:56Z","remediation":"升级 varstored 到包含 CVE-2025-58151 修复的版本，具体可通过更新 Xapi toolstack 至最新补丁版（关注 XenServer/XCP-ng 厂商安全公告）。如无法立即升级，可在 VM 配置中禁用 UEFI 启动并切换为 BIOS 模式作为临时缓解措施，或限制对受影响 VM 的管理操作并发数以降低竞争窗口命中概率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://xenbits.xen.org/xsa/advisory-478.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/27/2","http://xenbits.xen.org/xsa/advisory-478.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0614","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0614.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-15661","title":"libssh2 libssh2 SFTP 堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞","description":"libssh2 1.11.1 及之前版本的 src/sftp.c 中 sftp_symlink() 函数存在堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞。恶意 SSH 服务器或中间人攻击者可通过发送精心构造的 SSH_FXP_NAME 响应，在 SFTP READLINK 和 REALPATH 操作中提供超过实际数据包大小的 link_len 值，由于缺少对可用数据包缓冲区大小的验证直接执行 memcpy 操作，导致最多读取 target_len 减一字节的堆内存内容。该漏洞可导致敏感堆内存泄露或程序崩溃，CVSS 4.0 评分 8.3（HIGH），影响所有使用受影响版本 libssh2 进行 SFTP 通信的客户端应用。已在 commit 2dae302 中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-15661"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-06-18T21:16:27Z","updated":"2026-07-14T23:17:19Z","remediation":"立即升级 libssh2 到 1.11.2 或更高版本，其中包含对 sftp_symlink() 缓冲区过读漏洞的修复；如果无法立即更新，可临时禁用 SFTP 服务或限制 SSH 连接用户权限作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/libssh2/libssh2/commit/2dae3024897e1898d389835151f4e9606227721d","https://github.com/libssh2/libssh2/pull/1705","https://github.com/libssh2/libssh2/pull/1717","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/libssh2-heap-buffer-over-read-via-sftp-symlink-in-sftp-c","https://github.com/termux/termux-packages/blob/e3eac6d1c212df11ee1af3ebb6271a5a075e2502/packages/libssh2/CVE-2025-15661.patch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15661.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/a35af4fe1007b9d72f6e7348414b177ecf8343f7/pkgs/by-name/li/libssh2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15661.json","https://github.com/wolfi-dev/os/blob/83a159632bb6a80621b94385269b44c043258845/libssh2/CVE-2025-15661.patch","https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/3cfbeb621489eb7d9645a167f5c2aceb9ecac0a8/Formula/lib/libssh2.rb","https://github.com/openembedded/openembedded-core/blob/6a91494f29a1f9da28280bc93771714c4545da46/meta/recipes-support/libssh2/libssh2/CVE-2025-15661-1.patch","https://github.com/openembedded/openembedded-core/blob/6a91494f29a1f9da28280bc93771714c4545da46/meta/recipes-support/libssh2/libssh2/CVE-2025-15661-3.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-15661.json","https://github.com/openembedded/openembedded-core/blob/6a91494f29a1f9da28280bc93771714c4545da46/meta/recipes-support/libssh2/libssh2/CVE-2025-15661-2.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0614.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0427","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0427.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10263","title":"Arm 多款处理器内存访问竞态条件权限提升漏洞","description":"Arm 处理器在多款 CPU 核心（包括 Neoverse V3/V2/V1/N2/N1、Cortex-X925/X4/X3/X2/X1/A710/A78/A77/A76 等）的硬件实现中存在竞态条件漏洞。由于 TLBI（TLB 失效操作）完成并不能保证受影响的内存访问操作也已完成，攻击者可在 TLBI 执行与内存访问完成之间利用竞态窗口，向更高异常等级（如 EL3/EL2）所拥有的资源执行写入操作，从而突破权限隔离边界。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可导致机密性和完整性严重受损，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。受影响的厂商需通过微码更新或固件补丁修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10263"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-06-09T10:16:33Z","updated":"2026-07-23T08:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即更新系统内核至已修复版本：RHEL 8 升级至 kernel-4.18.0-553.140.1.el8_10，RHEL 9 升级至 kernel-5.14.0-687.22.1.el9_8，RHEL 10 升级至 kernel-6.12.0-211.30.1.el10_2；Xen 用户升级至包含 XSA-493 补丁的版本。同时更新 ARM 固件至官方文档 112137 中指定的修复版本，启用 speculative barrier 相关缓解措施。如无法立即打补丁，可在虚拟化环境中禁用受影响 CPU 核心的 SMT 作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://developer.arm.com/documentation/112137","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/06/09/13","http://xenbits.xen.org/xsa/advisory-493.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:34911","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:36018","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:36348","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:36349","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:40764","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-10263","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2486958","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2025/cve-2025-10263.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10263.json","https://github.com/raspberrypi/linux/blob/33bb14b06b3fb5a682d4a7a3db3963fe558fc6f9/arch/arm64/Kconfig","https://github.com/ARM-software/arm-trusted-firmware/blob/a5c580fd539929af41cf483b7c1434db261dd51b/docs/security_advisories/security-advisory-tfv-17.rst","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-06-09/TIER_3_CVE-2025-10263.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-10263","https://github.com/OP-TEE/optee_os/blob/991587c721a603e831cad228626078289adad159/core/arch/arm/arm.mk","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-10263.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51d0c9e0ce11ffd48a06c5251961beaf423d7c9a/content/posts/cve-2025-10263.md","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/a450964b4adf32a972407ab46f3c14bd51a1a393/advisories/cve/CVE-2025-10263.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12ccf92eecf2db493c63630fd06d8245f1d02476/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10263.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0427.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0013","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-22741","title":"RiceTheme Felan Framework 反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Felan Framework 插件（由 RiceTheme 开发）1.1.3 及之前版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入参数在生成 Web 页面时未进行充分的中和过滤，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制 URL，诱使用户点击后导致恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行，造成敏感信息泄露、会话劫持等危害。CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需用户特权即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-22741"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-27T09:16:26Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:49:42Z","remediation":"立即联系 RiceTheme 获取修复版本，或确认是否有 1.1.3 以上更新。如无法升级，部署 Web 应用防火墙（如 Wordfence、Patchstack）拦截反射型 XSS 攻击流量；同时在 WordPress 配置中添加 `Content-Security-Policy` 响应头限制脚本来源作为临时缓解措施。也可考虑暂时禁用 Felan Framework 插件直至官方补丁发布。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/felan-framework/vulnerability/wordpress-felan-framework-plugin-1-1-3-reflected-cross-site-scripting-xss-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/2025/22xxx/CVE-2025-22741.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/a47e10c73e8cfa90d75f3b72e70fb0d1cf7c5530/nuclei-templates/2025/CVE-2025-22741-felan_framework-3be71ddf-bb6f-492f-8d89-d0d850b27233.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/22xxx/CVE-2025-22741.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/e01cbd1436b3805fae6aac0fdbaa88371dfa18db/nvd/2025/HIGH/CVE-2025-22741/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/4e58fc35977c7899e2fc4be00dae1c243ec507c4/content/posts/cve-2025-22741.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-2025-22741.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e2c3d33b7e2870449a687c9b1cfa4c48990c946b/docs/2026/WordPress_Felan_Framework_%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%8D%E5%B0%84%E5%9E%8B_XSS_%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2025-22741.toml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2025-22741-felan_framework-3be71ddf-bb6f-492f-8d89-d0d850b27233.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc48b6c04c59ceff2d71da45cd843fc1d449dc48/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-22741.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3508ccc52a2baed6a1946843005e8957c7067f39/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-227xx/CVE-2025-22741.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-22741"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0613","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0613.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-15649","title":"Perl IO::Uncompress::Unzip 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Perl IO::Uncompress::Unzip 模块 2.215 版本之前存在异常处理缺陷，_dosToUnixTime() 函数在解析 ZIP 文件头的 DOS 日期字段时，直接调用 Time::Local::timelocal() 而未加 eval 保护。当 ZIP 头部包含格式错误的日期（如月份、日期或小时超出合法范围）时，timelocal() 会抛出异常导致程序崩溃，该异常会从 IO::Uncompress::Unzip->new() 向上传播，破坏调用者预期的错误处理流程。攻击者需具备本地访问权限并能诱导受害者解析恶意构造的 ZIP 文件，即可触发拒绝服务，CVSS 5.5（中危），影响可用性。升级至 2.215 或更高版本可修复该问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-15649"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-05-27T04:16:23Z","updated":"2026-07-24T12:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 IO::Uncompress::Unzip 模块到 2.215 或更高版本。可通过 CPAN 执行 `cpan IO::Uncompress::Unzip` 更新，或使用系统包管理器（如 `apt-get update && apt-get install libio-uncompress-unzip-perl`、`yum update perl-IO-Compress`）安装修复版本。若无法立即升级，可在应用层添加异常捕获包装解析调用，或拒绝处理来源不可信的 ZIP 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pmqs/IO-Compress/commit/fd28c1d2374eee9811f6d0c5bddc0957abdf1da8.patch","https://github.com/pmqs/IO-Compress/issues/65","https://metacpan.org/release/PMQS/IO-Compress-2.215/changes","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/05/27/1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15649.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2025/15xxx/CVE-2025-15649.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-15649.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-15649.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-15649.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-15649.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-156xx/CVE-2025-15649.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a0729be792e60156d89de75025b409016df9594f/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-15649.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2025-15649-2026-06-22-1705","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/2c866c27fe697535dca864b0ffb9170252ab9537/references/CVE-2025-15649-2026-07-31-0005"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0613.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0598","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0598.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14575","title":"Qt Qt Network OpenSSL TLS 后端不受控制的搜索路径元素允许恶意 CA 证书加载","description":"Qt Network 的 OpenSSL TLS 后端存在不受控制的搜索路径元素漏洞（CWE-427）。在 Unix 系统上，使用 Qt 框架的应用程序在加载 TLS 证书时，会将应用程序的工作目录纳入 CA 证书搜索路径。攻击者可在目标系统上放置一个伪造的 CA 证书文件到应用工作目录中，该文件会被 Qt Network 模块误认为受信任的系统证书颁发机构，从而加载并信任恶意 CA。这使得攻击者能够实施中间人攻击，拦截和解密应用程序的 TLS 加密通信。该漏洞影响 Qt Framework (Unix) 下使用 OpenSSL TLS 后端的应用程序，CVSS 评分为 1.8（低危），需要本地访问权限才能利用。","severity":"LOW","score":1.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14575"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-05-19T14:16:27Z","updated":"2026-07-29T10:16:35Z","remediation":"建议将 Qt (qtbase) 升级至已修复的版本：Qt 6.5.9、6.8.4 或 6.10.0 及更高版本。受影响的代码路径为 QtNetwork 中 QSslCertificate::fromPath() 方法，当传入空路径时会遍历当前工作目录加载证书文件，修复后该方法将在路径为空时直接返回空列表。对于 Unix/Linux 系统，可通过包管理器更新系统自带的 qt6-base 或 qtbase-opensource-src 包。如暂无法升级，应将应用程序的工作目录权限收紧，避免非特权用户可在其中放置恶意 .pem/.crt 证书文件，或显式指定受信任的 CA 证书目录路径以替代默认的系统搜索路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtbase/+/642967","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8e5677efdddb9343c4d7ff6efe8ac6dc3b41098/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14575.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/8f58f2aca6f1139bd32d3740409b3ec8a97c5059/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14575.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b858c1de67d8192aba338799e4dc25fc6df3edc6/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14575.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b858c1de67d8192aba338799e4dc25fc6df3edc6/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14575.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14575.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-14575.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/dcf23aed58c5cab14c2c44b30593196b46bb051f/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-145xx/CVE-2025-14575.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-14575","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/9ffc2f6c5c73933ab0668bbefe19806a431955a8/content/posts/cve-2025-14575.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b00ea0816ce55b8dcb9be2ee9fcf8a52e1e37b3f/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-14575.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0598.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0353","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12659","title":"Siemens Simcenter Femap 基于堆的缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"西门子 Simcenter Femap 在解析特制 IPT 文件时存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过向目标用户发送恶意构造的 IPT 文件触发内存损坏，导致在当前进程上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Simcenter Femap 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高危。建议用户及时更新至厂商发布的安全版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12659"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-12T14:16:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:45Z","remediation":"立即将 Siemens Simcenter Femap 升级至 V2512.0003 或更高版本，可从 Siemens 支持门户 (support.sw.siemens.com) 获取。如暂时无法升级，切勿打开来源不明的 IPT 文件，并遵循 Siemens Industrial Security 操作指南加强系统防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-870926.html","https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/develop/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-134-05.json","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-134-05","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12659.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/57037e9ca1e585082424bbd15c12a674807d0c21/content/posts/cve-2025-12659.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12659.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-12659.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-8qfq-8cwv-5jpc/GHSA-8qfq-8cwv-5jpc.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12659.json","https://github.com/icsadvprj/ICS-Advisory-Project/blob/49f0ea1611216d6891a0af73be95062138f0615b/ICS-CERT_ADV/CISA_ICS_ADV_2026_7_21_26.csv","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/f9f61f0882f53057e94aea140828cc5fcfb545d0/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-316.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4b8ac955bad6aa0d3b908ba92904a2bb4e3a4d85/data/2025/CVE-2025-12659.json","https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/92c3e620516775934c29e13374713abb0bb85fcb/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-134-05.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0590","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0590.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14179","title":"PHP PDO Firebird SQL注入漏洞","description":"这是一个针对 PHP PDO Firebird 驱动的 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者通过在引用字符串中插入 NUL 字节来绕过输入验证和参数化查询机制。在受影响的 PHP 版本中，当 Firebird 数据库驱动处理包含 NUL 字节的 quoted 字符串时，会导致字符串解析异常，攻击者可以利用这一点将恶意的 SQL 代码注入到查询中。该漏洞影响广泛的 PHP 版本（包括 8.2.x 之前版本、8.3.x 之前版本、8.4.x 之前版本和 8.5.x 之前版本），攻击者无需任何权限即可远程触发漏洞，只需向目标系统发送包含 NUL 字节的有效载荷的数据库查询请求即可利用此漏洞，成功后可以读取、修改或删除数据库中的敏感数据，甚至可能导致远程代码执行，威胁数据库安全和系统完整性。微软及 PHP 安全团队已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞，用户应及时更新到相关安全版本以获取保护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14179"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-05-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-05-10T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PHP 到以下修复版本：PHP 8.2.x 升级至 8.2.31+，PHP 8.3.x 升级至 8.3.31+，PHP 8.4.x 升级至 8.4.21+，PHP 8.5.x 升级至 8.5.6+。若使用 PHP 8.0/8.1 可应用 centminmod 提供的补丁（php80-cve-2025-14179.patch / php81-cve-2025-14179.patch）。临时缓解：禁用 pdo_firebird 扩展（php.ini 中注释 extension=pdo_firebird），或在应用层过滤输入中的 NUL 字符（\\0）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14179.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14179.json","https://github.com/centminmod/centminmod/blob/4b09ee7ab641598515138e70a98fbc69cf5a8eef/patches/php/php80-cve-2025-14179.patch","https://github.com/centminmod/centminmod/blob/4b09ee7ab641598515138e70a98fbc69cf5a8eef/patches/php/php81-cve-2025-14179.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14179.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14179.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-14179.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14179.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-14179.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-14179.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0590.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0579","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0579.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13763","title":"OpenSC libopensc 未初始化变量导致信息泄露或崩溃漏洞","description":"OpenSC 的 libopensc 库中存在多个未初始化变量的使用漏洞。攻击者可以通过构造特殊的 USB 设备或智能卡，在向系统发送精心设计的 APDU 响应时触发该漏洞。由于程序在处理这些响应时使用了未初始化的变量，可能导致内存中的敏感信息泄露或触发应用程序崩溃（DoS）。该漏洞影响使用 libopensc 的智能卡管理系统，攻击者需要具备物理接触权限且构造复杂的恶意响应方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13763"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-04-23T13:16:09Z","updated":"2026-06-30T07:16:30Z","remediation":"建议立即将 OpenSC 升级至 0.25.0 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可通过限制连接不可信的 USB 智能卡设备或使用受限的硬件驱动环境来减轻由恶意设备触发未初始化变量导致的崩溃或信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-13763","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2417581","https://github.com/OpenSC/OpenSC/security/advisories/GHSA-2v44-fq35-98vv","https://github.com/OpenSC/OpenSC/wiki/CVE-2025-13763","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2025/CVE-2025-13763.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb5dd86b4bb809c5906b249218c32efca5d1bc34/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13763.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a04a33e0a7b6dc51995fb6068d2a3e620109c10f/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13763.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/093c5941fc87f5111705731d4067bd31fc64fcb1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13763.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/093c5941fc87f5111705731d4067bd31fc64fcb1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13763.json","https://github.com/OpenSC/Wiki/blob/85519291e9f2ca7a2394f55021701a0acea66c56/CVE-2025-13763.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13763.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/53f6046d6bc3edd16e076ae391d494ba7302fe9f/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13763.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/53f6046d6bc3edd16e076ae391d494ba7302fe9f/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-13763.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13763.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0579.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0603","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0603.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14821","title":"libssh libssh Windows 不安全默认配置导致本地中间人攻击漏洞","description":"tags.\n\nLet me write a good description:\n\nlibssh 在 Windows 平台存在不安全默认配置漏洞（CWE-427，不受控制的搜索路径元素）。该库默认自动从 C:\\etc 目录加载配置文件，而该目录可由非特权本地用户创建和修改。本地攻击者利用该缺陷可劫持 SSH 连接的配置，实施中间人攻击，导致 SSH 安全降级、受信任主机信息被篡改，进而窃取凭据或篡改通信内容，严重威胁 SSH 通信的机密性、完整性与可用性。攻击前提是攻击者能在目标系统上以本地低权限用户身份操作。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级为高。\n\nThat covers principles, impact, attack conditions, exploitation. Good.分析：该漏洞为 libssh 在 Windows 平台的不安全默认配置问题（CWE-427 不受控制的搜索路径元素），本地攻击者可通过创建/篡改 C:\\etc 目录下的配置文件实施中间人攻击。\n\n<value>libssh 在 Windows 平台存在不安全默认配置漏洞（CWE-427，不受控制的搜索路径元素）。由于库默认自动从 C:\\etc 目录加载配置文件，而该目录可由非特权本地用户创建和修改，本地攻击者可借此植入恶意配置，对 SSH 连接实施中间人攻击，导致连接安全降级、受信任主机信息被篡改，进而窃取凭据或篡改通信数据，严重威胁 SSH 通信的机密性、完整性与可用性。攻击条件为攻击者需在目标系统上拥有本地低权限用户账户，无需用户交互即可触发。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 7.8，危害等级为高。\n","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14821"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-04-07T17:16:25Z","updated":"2026-06-30T07:16:31Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 libssh 至修复版本 0.11.4 或 0.12.0（可通过 GitHub Releases 或系统包管理更新）。如无法立即升级，在 Windows 上重新编译 libssh 时改用以下安全配置：CMake 传入 -DGLOBAL_BIND_CONFIG=C:/ProgramData/ssh/libssh_server_config 与 -DGLOBAL_CLIENT_CONFIG=C:/ProgramData/ssh/ssh_config，将配置文件重定向至受管目录；并在应用中通过 ssh_options_set(session, SSH_OPTIONS_GLOBAL_KNOWNHOSTS, \"C:/ProgramData/ssh/ssh_known_hosts\") 设置全局 known hosts 路径，避免加载可被普通用户创建的 C:\\etc 目录。同时建议以管理员权限回收 C:\\etc 目录归属或将其权限收紧至仅 SYSTEM/Administrators 可写，并排查该目录下是否已存在被篡改的 ssh_known_hosts 与配置文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:7067","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-14821","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2423148","https://www.libssh.org/2026/02/10/libssh-0-12-0-and-0-11-4-security-releases/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e409cc3aa72de0994d4d1b2baf38bcac39a42cdc/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14821.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/67e4f2259ee77a0081a521c1e645484964f36ab6/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14821.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14821.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14821.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fe13fea74df1c2902f4d8d9f41de46ac6e968bd/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-14821.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14821.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-14821.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-148xx/CVE-2025-14821.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e8af837966f4fe349aac88609ed5288e4a877c95/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-14821","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/4a660bd363c597c90b4e9cb0546a9652c249cb65/specs/l/libssh/libssh.spec"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0603.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0370","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0370.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-62843","title":"QHora QuRouter 权限提升漏洞","description":"QHora QuRouter 存在通信通道限制不当漏洞（CWE-923），攻击者通过物理接触目标设备，可绕过预期的端点访问控制机制，获取本应仅授予原始管理端口的特权权限。该漏洞影响 QuRouter 2.6.x 系列固件版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 6.8（中危），攻击向量为物理访问（AV:P），攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性全面受损。该漏洞由 Team DDOS 在 Pwn2Own 2025 大赛中报告，QNAP 已在 QuRouter 2.6.3.009 及更高版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-62843"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-21T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-03-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 QHora QuRouter 固件升级至 2.6.3.009 或更高版本，可通过 QNAP 官方下载中心或设备管理后台获取更新。同时限制设备物理接触，将路由器放置在受控上锁机柜中，禁用未使用的管理端口，并修改默认管理员密码。详细补丁信息请参考安全公告 QSA-26-12。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62843.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62843.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2025-62843.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-62843","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-62843.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-v9ww-wgw5-f4f7/GHSA-v9ww-wgw5-f4f7.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2025-62843","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-62843.json","https://github.com/Dunateo/dunateo.github.io/blob/a03dea1da7b27dc92780ffa358c00fad93f8e88f/content/news/1774357365090.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-03-23_10-08-13.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0370.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0373","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0373.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-62846","title":"QHora QuRouter SQL注入漏洞","description":"QHora QuRouter 存在 SQL 注入漏洞（CWE-89），攻击者需先获取管理员账户权限，随后可通过向路由器管理接口发送特制的 SQL 查询语句，绕过输入过滤机制执行未授权的 SQL 命令，进而实现任意代码执行或系统命令执行。该漏洞影响 QHora 系列路由器，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。该漏洞已在 Pwn2Own Ireland 2025 中被演示利用。厂商已在 QuRouter 2.6.2.007 及后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-62846"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-20T17:16:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:52:31Z","remediation":"立即将 QHora 设备上的 QuRouter 固件升级至 2.6.2.007 或更高版本。可通过 QHora 管理后台的「系统更新」功能在线升级，或从 QNAP 官方下载中心获取固件手动更新。作为临时缓解措施，应严格限制管理员账户的分配范围，避免将管理员权限授予不可信用户，并启用多因素认证（MFA）增强登录安全。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-26-12","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62846.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-03-20/TIER_2_CVE-2025-62846.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62846.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2025/HIGH/CVE-2025-62846/README.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-62846","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2025-62846.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-62846.md","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2025-62846","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-62846.json","https://github.com/psocik/ict/blob/7d78dc128b21c4cfd10257bd7b2b39346702bdfa/_posts/2026/2026-03-23-qnap_fixes_four_vulnerabilities_demonstrated_at_pwn2own_ireland_2025.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0373.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0372","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0372.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-62845","title":"QHora QuRouter 控制序列中和漏洞","description":"QHora QuRouter 存在转义序列中和不当漏洞（CWE-150），具有管理员权限的本地攻击者可通过向设备管理界面发送特制的控制序列，利用该漏洞绕过输入过滤机制，导致设备出现非预期行为，如信息泄露或配置篡改。该漏洞影响 QuRouter 2.6.3.009 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.6，危害等级中危。厂商已在 QuRouter 2.6.3.009 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-62845"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-20T17:16:42Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:52:31Z","remediation":"立即将 QHora QuRouter 升级至 2.6.3.009 或更新版本。如无法立即升级，应严格限制管理员账户的分配与使用，仅授予必要人员，并启用多因素认证；同时监控 QuRouter 管理界面的异常操作日志，及时发现可疑行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-26-12","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62845.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2025/62xxx/CVE-2025-62845.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2025-62845.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-62845","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-62845.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-7gpv-c5rv-9qxm/GHSA-7gpv-c5rv-9qxm.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2025-62845","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CV